---
import { GITHUB_URL, NAV_ITEMS, SITE_AUTHOR, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';

const today = new Date();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
	<div class="container footer-main">
		<div class="footer-intro">
			<a class="footer-brand" href="/">{SITE_TITLE}</a>
			<p>记录技术实践、项目复盘与成长经验。<br />慢一点写，认真一点活。</p>
		</div>

		<div class="footer-links" aria-label="页脚导航">
			<div>
				<span>浏览</span>
				{NAV_ITEMS.slice(1).map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
				<a href="/tags/">标签</a>
			</div>
			<div>
				<span>订阅与连接</span>
				<a href="/rss.xml">RSS 订阅</a>
				<a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
				<a href="/license/">授权说明</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="container footer-bottom">
		<p>
			© {today.getFullYear()} {SITE_AUTHOR}. 除特别注明外，本站原创文字内容采用
			<a
				href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/deed.zh-hans"
				target="_blank"
				rel="license noreferrer">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a
			> 授权。
		</p>
		<p>Designed &amp; written by {SITE_AUTHOR}</p>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	.site-footer {
		margin-top: 110px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
		background: var(--green-deep);
		color: rgb(241 238 227 / 70%);
	}

	.footer-main {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 64px;
		padding-block: 64px 52px;
	}

	.footer-brand {
		color: var(--paper-light);
		font-family: "Noto Serif SC", "Songti SC", serif;
		font-size: 32px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.footer-intro p {
		margin: 18px 0 0;
		font-size: 14px;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	.footer-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 76px;
	}

	.footer-links div {
		display: flex;
		min-width: 88px;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 10px;
	}

	.footer-links span {
		margin-bottom: 6px;
		color: var(--paper-light);
		font-size: 11px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.footer-links a {
		color: rgb(241 238 227 / 64%);
		font-size: 14px;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.footer-links a:hover {
		color: var(--paper-light);
	}

	.footer-bottom {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 24px;
		padding-block: 22px 28px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 10%);
		font-size: 11px;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}

	.footer-bottom p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.site-footer {
			margin-top: 72px;
		}

		.footer-main {
			flex-direction: column;
			padding-block: 48px 38px;
			gap: 42px;
		}

		.footer-links {
			gap: 48px;
		}

		.footer-bottom {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 8px;
		}
	}
</style>
